        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert social media copywriter.\nWrite a high-performing caption for the topic: \"{{ $json.Topic }}\". The video features ultra-realistic, AI-generated ASMR content where glass objects are being sliced with a knife. \nMake it scroll-stopping, short, and engaging.\n\nGenerate a short, non-generic caption for each platform. Captions must follow exact max-lengths and these best practices:\n\n• LinkedIn Shorts (max 3000 chars)\nStart with value (tip/stat)\nUse short lines or bullets\nEnd with a clear CTA\n\n• Facebook Reels (max 2200 chars)\nFirst 125 chars must punch\nUse line breaks or emojis\nInclude CTA within first 125\n2-3 relevant hashtags\n\n• TikTok (max 4000 chars)\nLead with CTA or question\n3-5 trending hashtags\nSprinkle emojis for tone\n\n• Instagram Reels (max 2200 chars)\nFirst 125 chars show before \"more\"\nUse emojis/line breaks\nUp to 5 hashtags at end\n\n• YouTube Shorts\n100 chars max for the caption\nInclude 2-3 hashtags (#Shorts, topic)\nOutput only valid JSON.\n\nExample JSON output:\n\n{\n  \"LinkedIn Shorts\": \"_\",\n  \"Facebook Reels\": \"_\",\n  \"TikTok\": \"_\",\n  \"Instagram Reels\": \"_\",\n  \"YouTube Shorts\": \"_\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_object"
            }
          }
        }
